ing a reply\n- Rosa Hale asked Wei-Ling Grant \"Wei-Ling, can you still do Feb 23?\"; no reply recorded.\n\n## Things people asserted that others may want to check\n- Marguerite Soto said Feb 9 clashes with the audit.\n- Andre Pike said the audit clash affects his team too.\n- Dana Okoye said the Denver venue deposit is $3,200 (seen only by Dana Okoye and Rosa Hale)."
